title: ch03_bark_causeway_ring
location: ch03/saltgrass_causeway
---
Rhen [surprised]: There's light in that crack. Lit Age ceramic, still lit. That's a month of food, sitting in the sand. #line:ch03_bark_causeway_ring_001
Toma [neutral]: Leave it. #line:ch03_bark_causeway_ring_002
Rhen [neutral]: ...Leaving it. #line:ch03_bark_causeway_ring_003
